(in-ns 'go.arbace.py) ^{:go/comments [[8 1 "// Descriptors (PY5c; CPython's Objects/descrobject.c, funcobject.c's classmethod and staticmethod,"] [9 1 "// classobject.c's method, typeobject.c's super and slot wrappers): bound methods, functions as"] [10 1 "// descriptors, classmethod, staticmethod, property, __slots__' members, super, the slot wrappers"] [11 1 "// that show a built-in type's slots as methods, and the attributes of types, functions and methods."] [15 2 "// MethodWrapperType is method-wrapper (descrobject.c's _PyMethodWrapper_Type, queue 290): a slot wrapper bound to an"] [16 2 "// instance ((2).__pow__, object().__str__), a *Method whose Func is a *slotWrapper; inspect's _NonUserDefinedCallables"] [17 2 "// tell it from a Python bound method"] [19 2 "// ClassMethodDescrType is classmethod_descriptor (descrobject.c's PyClassMethodDescr_Type, queue 290): a built-in"] [20 2 "// type's class method as its class holds it (dict.__dict__['fromkeys']), a *ClassMethod not made by classmethod()"] [21 2 "// around a *Builtin"] [32 1 "// Method is a bound method: a function and the object it is bound to."] [35 2 "// bySuper: a slot wrapper bound by a super object's attribute (Builtin's bySuper, queue 595)"] [46 1 "// ClassMethod and StaticMethod wrap a callable."] [48 12 "// made by classmethod(...), not a built-in type's"] [60 1 "// isDescr: c is a built-in type's classmethod_descriptor (a *Builtin not wrapped by classmethod())."] [76 1 "// directBase is b among s's bases (its Base when it has no Bases)."] [89 1 "// Property is property(fget, fset, fdel, doc)."] [92 28 "// nil when unset (prop_name NULL, queue 304: __name__ = None is a name)"] [93 28 "// a subclass of property"] [94 2 "// getterDoc is the doc taken from the getter (getter_doc); dict and slots a subclass's instance's (queue 304:"] [95 2 "// property_init's subclass rule puts __doc__ there)"] [108 1 "// Member is a __slots__ entry's descriptor."] [117 1 "// Super is super(type, obj)."] [126 1 "//